    <item>
      <title>迪士尼樂園希望大家放下手機　竟推薦更「令人分心」的裝置？</title>
      <link>https://www.pcmarket.com.hk/disney-land-urges-visitors-to-put-away-their-phones-yet-recommends-something-even-more-distracting/</link>
      <description>去旅行，很多人都會選擇到主題公園遊玩，不過隨著智能手機及社交媒體的普及，更多人都會用手機在園內拍片、拍照、打卡。迪士尼樂園的管理層則認為，遊客們只顧拍照其實正在毀掉迪士尼樂園的魔法，所以他們在迪士尼 YouTube 頻道最新一集《We Call It Imagineering》中卻推薦大家使用另一類裝置…</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.pcmarket.com.hk/disney-land-urges-visitors-to-put-away-their-phones-yet-recommends-something-even-more-distracting/</guid>
      <enclosure url="https://cdn.pcmarket.com.hk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/01021214/disney-land-urges-visitors-to-put-away-their-phones-yet-recommends-something-even-more-distracting-FB.jpg" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/>
